<title>USA: Sirena Apparel Group settles lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Sirena Apparel Group settles lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sirena Apparel Group Inc, a manufacturer of women's branded and private label swim and resort wear, said Wednesday it has settled a lawsuit with Prestigio de C.V.</p>
<p>The settlement agreement requires that its terms remain undisclosed, Sirena said.</p>
